Codec2 source corresponding to the bundled binaries is available from:
https://github.com/drowe67/codec2/tree/06d4c11e699b0351765f10398abb4f663a984f36

The exact source list, build flags, generated-codebook inputs, and Android NDK
build procedure are recorded in codec2/src/main/cpp/CMakeLists.txt in this
